# machine-translated
#: data/ui/preferences.blp:87
msgid ""
"Leave AI-generated tracks out of lists and skip them during playback. TIDAL "
"does not expose its AI content preference through the API, so this setting "
"is stored locally."
msgstr ""
"Exclut les morceaux générés par IA des listes et les passe pendant la "
"lecture. TIDAL ne fournit pas sa préférence de contenu IA via son API, ce "
"réglage est donc enregistré localement."

